{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一行大号白字，金色强调的“憋着气”和“当作自己人”最先吸引视线；随后中部两行大号灰白文字也很显眼，形成第二个视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"看出他仍憋着气，想起曾被当作自己人而短暂高兴；是否正处于离开后的处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴。\",\n  \"missed\": \"离开后是否会更好、旧日已经无法回去，以及短暂高兴之后转为心酸的情绪变化。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块大号文字都很醒目，顶部叙述和中部问句争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在顶部叙述与中部问句里，需要拼接才能确认离开的处境和完整的情绪转折。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "506f3e14-a811-469d-8f81-721ba1cbd47a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T022220926089Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:22:52.805585+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3e910cc6a27b416b0150bcec609b8f54d6b8369760ef9f2965f5ac0439a875aa", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6